// Foreman's loadout (openspec/changes/signature-weapons; survey G20, owner, 2026-10-26: "Approve all"). Hand-tuned:
// tools/mechs/gen_mech_data.py writes foreman.ron and leaves this file alone. The signature weapon is first and
// starred on the WEAPONS page. Speeds m/s, intervals s, penetration mm, blast MJ, heat a share of the weapon heat
// bank (a shot, or a second of beam), which cools from full in 20 s (survey G23). Starting numbers: playtests tune them.
// The boom cannon: three 120 mm shells in 0.4 s from one pull, belt-fed, every 4 s, on the left arm.
(
    weapons: [
        (name: "boom cannon", socket: "MUZZLE_L", arm: ArmL, group: 1, speed_m_s: 850.0, interval_s: 4.0,
         penetration_mm: 260.0, damage: 70.0, blast_mj: 5.0, burst: Some((count: 3, gap_s: 0.2)), signature: true),
        (name: "35 mm autocannon", socket: "MUZZLE_R", arm: ArmR, group: 0, speed_m_s: 1100.0, interval_s: 0.12,
         penetration_mm: 90.0, damage: 12.0, blast_mj: 0.4),
        (name: "shoulder missile", socket: "MISSILE_POD", arm: Torso, group: 2, speed_m_s: 260.0, interval_s: 1.2,
         penetration_mm: 150.0, damage: 45.0, blast_mj: 2.5, kind: Rocket, seeker_turn_deg_s: 70.0, rounds: Some(40)),
